{{ ref: 872eed69-f4b6-4d59-bbe1-8728045b7a41 }}
This document defines the architectural principles that guide everything we build — from services and APIs to infrastructure and operations. These aren't abstract ideals; they're practical guardrails that keep our systems consistent, reliable, and maintainable as we scale.
--{ ref: 872eed69-f4b6-4d59-bbe1-8728045b7a41 }--

