{{ ref: 4c39aec2-a7c2-4c35-a26d-ee9268c5f3a4 }}
## 💻 API Design
--{ ref: 4c39aec2-a7c2-4c35-a26d-ee9268c5f3a4 }--

{{ ref: 85b5f97c-3535-4e88-9727-b62c952f74e3 }}
### Explicit Over Implicit
--{ ref: 85b5f97c-3535-4e88-9727-b62c952f74e3 }--

{{ ref: 4de4e36f-eeec-4203-8c66-560a6eacc5bd }}
APIs should require explicit intent. Avoid magic defaults or implicit behaviors that surprise callers.
--{ ref: 4de4e36f-eeec-4203-8c66-560a6eacc5bd }--

{{ ref: 48559ea5-ec94-40f9-97bc-9637f523a0db }}
```typescript
// ✅ explicit intent
createUser({ name: "Alice", role: "member", permissions: ["read"] });

// ❌ implicit behavior
createUser({ name: "Alice" }); // what role? what permissions?
```
--{ ref: 48559ea5-ec94-40f9-97bc-9637f523a0db }--

{{ ref: a93dc67b-0685-4075-b85f-af8f81c60bdc }}
### Fail Fast
--{ ref: a93dc67b-0685-4075-b85f-af8f81c60bdc }--

{{ ref: 585c0a04-a6da-4b7f-9fa5-e4be63e16a24 }}
Validate inputs early and return clear errors. Don't proceed with invalid data.
--{ ref: 585c0a04-a6da-4b7f-9fa5-e4be63e16a24 }--

{{ ref: 0211c760-d772-4831-8011-571ff4489c43 }}
```typescript
// ✅ early validation
function process(data: Input) {
  validateInput(data); // throws immediately if invalid
  // processing with confidence...
}

// ❌ late failure
async function process(data: Input) {
  // ... 100 lines of processing ...
  if (!data.required) throw new Error("Missing field"); // too late!
}
```
--{ ref: 0211c760-d772-4831-8011-571ff4489c43 }--

{{ ref: c0bc8f97-ae3e-4781-9afc-6482aa8d7583 }}
### Versioning
--{ ref: c0bc8f97-ae3e-4781-9afc-6482aa8d7583 }--

{{ ref: 1f19110f-4ea1-49af-a6fb-46e6e0801faf }}
APIs are versioned. Breaking changes require new versions — we never break existing clients.
--{ ref: 1f19110f-4ea1-49af-a6fb-46e6e0801faf }--

{{ ref: 91563c2b-66e8-4b53-a6c4-82f750b594d7, table_width: 3 }}
| Version | Path      | Status     |
| ------- | --------- | ---------- |
| v1      | `/v1/users` | Deprecated |
| v2      | `/v2/users` | Current    |
--{ ref: 91563c2b-66e8-4b53-a6c4-82f750b594d7 }--

